### 4.3 Acceptance checklist

| Requirement | Proof |
|---|---|
| Single explicit route contract | `GatewayRoute` in `gateway_route.go` |
| Direct-provider behavior preserved | `TestDirectProviderBehaviorPreserved` |
| Fail closed before egress | `TestNoEgressOnInvalidToolRoute`, `Validate()` calls before `Do` |
| `structured_llm.go` unused var fixed | `requestedProvider` threaded into `route` |
